   apply 'choose' to btAdd in frame fPage5.
END.

/* _UIB-CODE-BLOCK-END */
&ANALYZE-RESUME


&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _CONTROL brDigita wReport
ON OFF-END OF brDigita IN FRAME fPage5
